sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Leader
    participant W as Workers (N shards)
    participant T as Tuple Space

    C->>L: run(workers, batches, events_per_batch)
    L->>W: create shard group

    loop each batch round
        L->>W: process_batch
        W->>W: filter, enrich, transform<br/>(simulated counts)
        W->>T: write stage_summary
        W-->>L: event counts, bytes, top streams
        L->>T: read stage summaries
        L->>L: merge top streams across workers
    end

    L->>L: collect per-node and per-role stats
    L-->>C: events/sec, timing, drop counts
